title: Shopkeeper_Quest
---
<<declare $pretty_medallion to false>>
<<declare $worn_book to false>>
<<declare $fancy_arrow to false>>
<<declare $honey_brittle to false>>

Brom: Greetings traveler. Take a look around. I can guarantee that something will peak your interest.
    -> Honey Brittle \[2 coins\] <<if $coins >= 2>> 
        <<set $coins to ($coins - 2)>>
        <<set $honey_brittle to true>>
        <color=\#db8f1d>\[Honey Brittle has been added to your inventory!\]</color>
    -> Pretty Medallion \[2 coins\] <<if $coins >= 2>>
        <<set $coins to ($coins - 2)>>
        <<set $pretty_medallion to true>>
        <color=\#db8f1d>\[A Pretty Medallion has been added to your inventory!\]</color>
    -> Worn Book\[2 coins\] <<if $coins >= 2>>
        <<set $coins to ($coins - 2)>>
        <<set $worn_book to true>>
        <color=\#db8f1d>\[A Worn Book has been added to your inventory!\]</color>
    -> Fancy Arrow \[2 coins\] <<if $coins >= 2>>
        <<set $coins to ($coins - 2)>>
        <<set $fancy_arrow to true>>
        <color=\#db8f1d>\[A Fancy Arrow has been added to your inventory!\]</color>
    -> Don't buy anything and leave.
===
